    {
      "id": "p0094-b002",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "Juggling priorities is incredibly common in entertainment localization. Sometimes there are no perfect solutions to localization problems, only imperfect approximations",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.1141922,
          0.0878571,
          0.2722259,
          0.2228571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.1141922,
          0.0878571,
          0.2722259,
          0.2228571
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "在娱乐作品本地化中，权衡各项优先级非常常见。有些问题没有完美的解法，只能做出不完美的近似处理。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
