    {
      "id": "p0094-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "The main character comes across four rocks sitting next to four switches. Three of the rocks are easily pushed onto their switches, but a sign on a wall suggests that the fourth rock might be a bit different. In English, this sign says:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.2895587,
          0.2321429,
          0.9104785,
          0.2871429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2895587,
          0.2321429,
          0.9104785,
          0.2871429
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "主角遇到四块石头，旁边有四个开关。其中三块很容易就能推到开关上，但墙上的牌子暗示，第四块可能有些不同。英文牌子写道：",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
