    {
      "id": "p0094-b011",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "As a translator, recognizing pop culture references can be a bigger challenge than localizing them. It’s not really a skill that’s taught in textbooks or classes – you just have to absorb on your own. Even then, you’ll never know as much about a country’s pop culture as a native who grew up surrounded by it. This is why it was so helpful to have Toby involved in Undertale’s localization process, along with others who grew up surrounded by the same pop culture.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.3038327,
          0.795,
          0.8921262,
          0.8892857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.3038327,
          0.795,
          0.8921262,
          0.8892857
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "对译者来说，认出流行文化典故，有时比将它们本地化还难。这并不是教科书或课堂能教会的技能，你只能自己慢慢积累。即便如此，你对一个国家流行文化的了解，也很难比得上从小浸润其中的当地人。这就是为什么让 Toby，以及其他在相同文化环境中长大的人，参与 Undertale 的本地化会如此有帮助。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
